From: Fil Dunsky <filipp.dunsky@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 21:17:39 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: vendor-prefixes: Add Securifi

Securifi Ltd. makes the Almond series of touchscreen Wi-Fi routers.
Add a vendor prefix for it.

Reviewed-by: Linus Walleij <linusw@kernel.org>
Acked-by: Conor Dooley <conor.dooley@microchip.com>
Signed-off-by: Fil Dunsky <filipp.dunsky@gmail.com>
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20261013-b4-cs75xx-v6-1-37e8f3969b7c@gmail.com
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
@@ -1397,6 +1397,8 @@ patternProperties:
     description: SDMC Technology Co., Ltd
   "^seagate,.*":
     description: Seagate Technology PLC
+  "^securifi,.*":
+    description: Securifi Ltd.
   "^seeed,.*":
     description: Seeed Technology Co., Ltd
   "^seirobotics,.*":
